		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>40 feet tall and weighing 20 tons, this brass and copper human-shaped automaton has four arms, one ending in a cannon.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 67, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +10 (3d6) and 1 cannon (distant) +10 (6d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 14</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Clockwork</strong>. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Double damage from electricity.</p><p></p><p><strong>Self-Destruct</strong>. On next turn when reduced below 15 HP, explodes in concussive blast, far-sized cube centered on clockwork. DEX 15+ or 6d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
